<title>SPAIN: Data show Spain within reach of EMU - Rato.</title>
<headline>Data show Spain within reach of EMU - Rato.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Thursday economic data showed Spain was &quot;within reach&quot; of meeting its goal of joining the European common currency.  </p>
<p>Rato, speaking to journalists at a news conference on CPI data, said Spain would make the grade at the European currency's launch.</p>
<p>Earlier, the National Statistics Institute said CPI rose 0.3 percent in January, dropping to a modest 2.9 percent year-on-year, slightly beneath market expectations.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
